  "changes": [
    "Internal package scope changed to the local Darbot namespace.",
    "Internal dependencies use workspace references; packages are private.",
    "Production implementation and required build inputs retained; upstream test suites and publishing hooks are not imported.",
    "Bun replaces the upstream package manager in build commands.",
    "Original copyright and license notices are retained unchanged.",
    "Source formatting follows the host Biome configuration; the legacy GraphQL resolvers retain their TypeScript parameter-decorator syntax.",
    "Display text and documentation use plain labels; channel reaction mappings retain their original values as ASCII Unicode escapes.",
    "Runtime type resolution uses package export maps instead of a declaration-file path alias, preventing Bun from executing declarations; schema generation keeps its CommonJS resolver.",
    "Inspector CSS generation precedes bundling. Generated GraphQL, schema, and stylesheet outputs are rebuilt rather than checked in or hand-formatted.",
    "GraphQL schema generation is serialized with client code generation for clean builds.",
    "RxJS is unified at the existing protocol version; runtime provider development versions follow the pinned source lock.",
    "Node-only ambient types isolate aimock from host Bun globals, and the legacy Zod converter uses its own input type contract."
  ]
}
